hadiths[51]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2478","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey kisi ko zayed pani sey mana nahin karna chahiye taake uskey zariey sey ghaas rok ley ."
"2479","Haddasana Abdullah bin Saeed ne kaha, humein Abdah bin Sulaiman ne bayan kiya, Harithah se, Amrah se, Aisha se, unhone kaha Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Paani ka fazil (ziyada) nahi roka jaaye aur na hi kunwe ka paani (jach) roka jaaye.\"""""""
"2480","Hazrat Abdullah bin Zuber (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik Ansari aadmi ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) key khilaf Harra key nadi naalon key barey mein shikayat pesh ki, wo us sey khajuron key baghaat sairab kartey they. Ansari ney kaha : pani guzar kar (meri zamin mein) aaney dijiye . Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ney inkar kya, chunanche wo dono apna muqadma ley kar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho gaey . Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ( dono key بیانات sun kar) farmaya : Zuber ! (apney baagh ko) pani dey kar apney hamsaaey (key baagh) ki taraf pani chhod diya karo. Ansari ko (us faisley sey) nagawari mehsus hui to usney kaha : Allah key Rasool ! (aap ney unkey haq mein faisla diya hai) kyonkey wo aap ki phuphi ka beta hai. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key chehra Mubarak ka rang tabdeel (ho kar surkh) ho gaya . phir aap ney farmaya : aey Zuber ! (baagh ko) pani do , phir pani rok rakho yahan tak key wo munderon tak pahunch jaey . Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : Allah ki qism ! merey khayal mein ye aayat usi barey mein nazil hui hai : ( فَلَا وَرَبِّكَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ حَتَّىٰ يُحَكِّمُوكَ فِيمَا شَجَرَ بَيْنَهُمْ ثُمَّ لَا يَجِدُوا۟ فِىٓ أَنفُسِهِمْ حَرَجًا مِّمَّا قَضَيْتَ وَيُسَلِّمُوا۟"
"2481","Hazrat Solba bin abu-Malik Qarzi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wadie-mahzor key Selabi pani key barey mein ye faisla diya ke ooper wala nichey waley sey (pani leney ka) ziyada haq rakhta hai. ooper wala ( khet ko) takhnon tak pani dey , phir apney sey nichey waley ki taraf pani chhod dey ."
"2482","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wadi mahzor key Sailabi pani key barey mein ye faisla diya ke aadmi pani rokey yahan tak key takhnon tak pani pahunch jaey, phir wo (doosrey key liye) pani chhod dey ."
"2483","Hazrat Ubada bin Samit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney sailab key pani sey khajuron key baagh ko seenchney key barey mein ye faisla diya ke ooper wala nichey waley sey pehley pani ley, aur pani takhnon tak chhoda jaey, phir pani us sey muttasil nichey waley ki taraf chhod diya jaey, isi tarah (silsila jari rahey) yahan tak key baagh khatam ho jaeyn ya pani khatam ho jaey."
"2484","Haddasana Ibrahim bin Al-Mundhir Al-Hizami ne kaha, humein Abu Al-Ja'd Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah ne khabar di, Kathir bin Abdullah bin Amr bin Awf Al-Muzani se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhone kaha Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Ghode ko unke paani peene ke din pehliyaan di jaaye.\"""""""
"2485","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo taqseem zamanae-jahiliyat mein ho chuki hai, wo jis tarah taqseem ho gaee hai isi tarah rahegi. aur jo taqseem Islam key zamaney mein hogi, wo Islam key tariqa taqseem key mutabiq hogi ."
"2486","Haddasana Al-Walid bin Amr bin Sukain ne kaha, humein Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Al-Muthanna ne bayan kiya, aur Haddasana Al-Hasan bin Muhammad bin As-Sabbah ne kaha, humein Abdul Wahhab bin Ata ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha humein Ismail Al-Makki ne bayan kiya, Al-Hasan se, Abdullah bin Mughaffal se, ki Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jisne kunwa khoda"","" uske liye uske jaanwaro(n) ke paani pine ke liye chalis haath (zameen) hai.\"""""""
"2487","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kunwen ka Hareem (mutalliqa raqba) uskey rassey ki lambaai key barabar hota hai."
"2488","Hazrat Ubada bin Samit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke agar khajuron key baagh mein eik, do ya teen darkht kisi doosrey shakhs key hon, aur un mein ikhtilaf ho jaey (ke kis ki kitni zamin hai) to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ye faisla diya ke har darkht ki jad sey ley kar jahan tak uski shaakhen pahunchti hain, wo us darkht ka raqba hai."
"2489","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khajoor key darkht ka hareem uski shaakhon key phailaao tak hai."
"2490","Hazrat Saeed bin Hurais (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney koi ghar ya zamin ka tukda ( khet ya baagh waghera) farokht kya aur uski qeemat ko us jaisi chiz mein kharch na kya to wo is laaiq hai ke is mein barkat na di jaey.) (Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney eik dusri sanad sey ye riwayat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey isi tarah bayan ki hai."
"2491","Haddasana Hisham bin Ammar aur Amr bin Rafi ne kaha, humein Marwan bin Muawiyah ne bayan kiya, humein Abu Malik An-Nakhai ne bayan kiya, Yusuf bin Maimun se, Abu Ubaidah bin Huzayfah se, apne walid Huzayfah bin Al-Yaman se, unhone kaha Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jisne ghar becha aur uski qeemat waisi hi (doosri jagah) na lagi"","" to usme uske liye barkat nahi hogi.\"""""""
"2492","Haddasana Hisham bin Ammar aur Muhammad bin As-Sabbah ne kaha, humein Sufyan bin Uyainah ne bayan kiya, Abu Az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhone kaha Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jis ke paas khajoor ke darakht ya zameen ho to woh use na beche jab tak apne shareek ko na dikhaye.\"""""""
"2493","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jiskey paas zamin ho aur wo usey bechna chahey to usey chahiye ke apney hamsaaey ko) kharidney ki) pesh kaash! kerey."
"2494","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : hamsaaya apney hamsaaey key Shufey ka ziyada haq rakhta hai. agar (hamsaaya) ghair hazir ho to us (key Shufey) ka intizar kya jaey jabke un dono ka raasta eik ho."
"2495","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah aur Ali bin Muhammad ne kaha, humein Sufyan bin Uyainah ne bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Maysarah se, Amr bin Ash-Sharid se, Abu Rafi' se, ki Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Padosi apni (mutasila) zameen ka zyada haqdaar hai.\"""""""
"2496","Hazrat shareed bin Suwed Saqafi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey arz kya : aey Allah key Rasool! wo zamin jis mein kisi ka hissa ya sharaakat nahin, sirf ham-saayegi hai (uska kya hukm hai?) Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : hamsaaya apney qarib ki jagah ka ziyada haq daar hai."
"2497","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ghair taqseem shuda chiz (zameen ya makaan) mein Shufey ka faisla farmaya. jab had bandi ho jaey to phir koi shufa nahin . Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney apney doosrey ustad Muhammad bin Hammad Tahrani key wastey sey bhi ye riwayat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey isi tarah bayan ki hai. (hadees key Raavi) abu-Aasim (Rahimahullah) ney kaha : Saeed bin Musaiyab ki Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat mursal hai. aur abu-Salma ki Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat muttasil hai."
"2498","Haddasana Abdullah bin Al-Jarrah ne kaha, humein Sufyan bin Uyainah ne bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Maysarah se, Amr bin Ash-Sharid se, Abu Rafi' se, unhone kaha Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Shareek apne hisse ka zyada haqdaar hai"","" jab tak woh shareek ho.\"""""""
"2499","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney har us chiz mein shufa muqarrar kya hai jo taqseem na ki gaee ho. jab had-bandi ho jaey aur raastey alag-alag ho jaeyn to phir koi shufa nahin ."
"2500","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : shufaa oont ki rassi kholney ki tarah hai. (jis tarah rassi khulney sey oont fauran azad ho jata hai, isi tarah shufey ka dawaa fori tor par qabile-qubul hai. junhi zamin ya makaan ki farokht ki khabar miley to dawa kerey. baad mein ye dawa qabile-qubul nahin hai.)"
"2501","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : eik shareek ko doosrey shareek par shufey ka haq nahin, jab wo is sey pehley kharid ley. na chhotey (naabaaligh) bachey ko haq shufaa hasil hai, na ghair hazir ko ."
"2502","Haddasana Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna ne kaha, humein Yahya bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, Humaid Al-Tawil se, Al-Hasan se, Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin Ash-Shikhkhir se, apne walid se, unhone kaha Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Muslim ki khoyi hui cheez (jise utha liya) aag ka indhan (jalane ki lakdi) hai.\"""""""
"2503","Hazrat munzir bin Jareer (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main maqam Bawazij par apney walid (Hazrat Jareer bin Abdullah bijli (Raziallahu anhu)) key sath tha ke gayen (charagaah sey wapis) ayen. unhen (rewad mein) eik gaey nazar aai jo unhen ajnabi mehsus hui ( mehsus huwa ke hamari nahin) to unhoney farmaya : ye kaisi gaey hai? haazirin ney kaha : (kisi ki) gaey (hamari) gaayon key sath mil kar aa gaee hai. Hazrat Jareer (Raziallahu anhu) key hukm sey us ko haank diya gaya yahan tak key wo nazron sey ojhal ho gaee , phir unhoney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna hai, aap ney farmaya : bhatkey huye ( gum shuda) janwer ko (apney rewad mein) wohi jagah deta hai jo bhatka huwa ( gumrah) hai."
"2504","Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid johni (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey huye farmaya ke aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey gum shuda oont key barey mein daryaft kya gaya to aap naraz ho gaey aur aap key rukhsaar Mubarak ( ghussey sey) surkh ho gaey aur farmaya : tujhey us sey kya gharz? uskey paas jootey bhi hain aur mashk bhi. wo pani ( key chashmon) par jaeyga (aur pani pi liya kerega) aur darakhton key pattey khata rahega yahan tak key uska Malik us tak pahunch jaey. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey gum shuda bakri key barey mein puchha gaya to aap ney farmaya : usey pakad ley . wo teri hai ya terey bhai ki ya bhediye ki. aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey giri padi chiz key barey mein sawal kya gaya to aap ney farmaya : uski thaili ko aur bandhan ko pehchan ley, aur eik saal tak uska aelan kar, agar koi usey pehchan ley (to behtar hai) warna usey apney maal mein mila ley."
"2505","Hazrat ayaaz bin himaar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ko kisi ki gum shuda chiz miley to usey chahiye ke eik ya do moatabar aadmiyon ko gawah bana ley . phir is mein tabdili na karey aur na usey chupaey. iskey baad agar uska Malik aa jaey to wo (Malik) uska ziyada haq daar hai warna wo Allah ka maal hai jisey wo chahta hai, dey deta hai."
"2506","Hazrat Suwed bin Ghafala (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Hazrat Zaid bin Sohaan aur Hazrat Salman bin Rabeea (Rahimahullah) key sath safar par rawana huwa . jab hum maqam Uzeb par pahunchey to mujhey kisi ka gira huwa koda mila. un dono hazraat ney kaha : usey phenk do . mainey ( phainkney sey) inkar kar diya . jab hum Madina Munawra pahunchey to mainey Hazrat Ubai-bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar waqia bayan kya (taake masla malum ho jaey ( unhoney farmaya : tu ney sahih kya. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamana Mubarak mein mujhey ( kisi key girey huye) so Dinar miley they, chunanche mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey masla daryaft kya to aap ney farmaya : eik saal tak unka aelan karo . mainey aelan kya to koi us raqam ko pehchan kar leney wala na mila . mainey phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha to aap ney farmaya : uska aelan karo . main phir aelan karta raha lekin mujhey koi us raqam ko pehchan kar leney wala na mila . tab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uski thaili, bandhan aur tadaad yad rakho, phir eik saal tak aelan karo, agar koi us ko pehchanney wala aa gaya ( to theek) warna wo tumharey (doosrey) maal ki tarah (halal maal) hai."
"2507","Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid Johni (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey (kisi ki gum-shuda) uthai hui chiz key barey mein sawal kya gaya to aap ney farmaya : uska eik saal tak aelan kar. agar usey koi pehchan ley to wo usey dey dey . agar na pehchani jaey to uski thaili aur bandhan ki pehchan rakh aur usey istimal kar ley. (baad mein) agar uska Malik aa jaey to wo (raqam) usey ada kar dena ."
"2508","Hazrat Zabaa bint Zuber Raziallahu anhu Alaiha ney Hazrat miqdaad bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat bayan ki ke wo eik din qazaey-hajat key liye Baqee key qabristaan ki taraf gaey. (us zamaney mein) logon ki haalat ye thi ke aadmi do teen din main eik baar qazaey-hajat key liye jata. (tab bhi) is tarah mengniyan karta jis tarah oont mengniyan kartey hain. wo eik khandar mein chaley gaey. wo qazaey-hajat key liye bethey huye they ke eik chooha nazar aaya . usney bil mein sey eik Dinar nikala, phir bil mein gaya aur eik aur Dinar nikal laya yahan tak key usney (eik-eik kar key) satrah Dinar nikaley . phir eik surkh kapdey ka tukda nikal laya . Hazrat miqdaad kehtey hain : mainey kapdey ko utha kar dekha to mujhey is mein bhi eik Dinar mila . ye sab atthaara Dinar ho gaey . main unhen ley kar (khandar sey) bahar aa gaya aur unhen la kar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kar diya. aur un dinaron key milney ka waqia arz kya aur mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool! unki zakat ley lijiye . Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : unhen ley jao, un mein koi zakat nahin (kyonkey bees Dinar ka nisab pura nahin huwa.) Allah tujhey un mein barkat dey. phir farmaya : shayad tu ney bil mein haath dala hoga? mainey kaha : nahin, qism hai us zaat ki jisney aap ko haq key sath izzat bakhshi! Raavi ney kaha : un ki wafat tak wo Dinar khatam na huye ."
"2509","Haddasana Muhammad bin Maimoon al-Makki aur Hisham bin Ammar, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Sufyan bin Uyainah, Zuhri se, unhone Saeed aur Abu Salama se, unhone Abu Hurairah se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Rikaz mein khumus (paanchwan hissa) hai.”"
"2510","Haddasana Nasr bin Ali al-Jahdami, haddasana Abu Ahmad, Israil se, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Rikaz mein khumus hai.”"
"2511","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum sey pehley logon main eik aadmi tha, usney zamin khareedi to usey zamin mein soney ka bhara huwa eik maat (bada matka) mila . usney (bechney waley sey) kaha : mainey tujh sey zamin khareedi hai, sona nahin kharid . (isliye ye sona tum ley lo.) usney kaha : mainey tujhey zamin bechi aur jo kuch is mein tha (wo bhi sath hi bik gaya, isliye sona tumhara hai.) chunanche wo eik (teesrey) aadmi key paas apna muqadma ley gaey to usney kaha : kya tumhari koi aulad hai? eik ney kaha : mera eik ladka hai. aur doosrey ney kaha : meri eik ladki hai. us (faisla karney waley) ney kaha : ladkey ka nikah ladki sey kar do. wo dono us maal mein sey apni zaat par bhi kharch karen aur sadqa bhi karen ."
"2512","Haddasana Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Numair aur Ali bin Muhammad, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Wakee, haddasana Ismail bin Abi Khalid, Salamah bin Kuhail se, Ata se, Jabir se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mudabbar (ghulam ko) becha."
"2513","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hamarey qabiley key eik aadmi ney eik ghulam ko mudabbir qarar dey diya . uskey paas us ghulam key ilawa koi maal nahin tha. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us ( ghulam) ko farokht kar diya . usey qabila banu Adi key eik shakhs ibn Nahaam (Raziallahu anhu) ney kharid liya."
"2514","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mudabbir (tarkey key) teesrey hissey mein (sey azad hota) hai. Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Usman bin abi sheeba (Rahimahullah) ko ye farmatey suna : ye hadees, yani mudabbir teesrey hissey mein hai, ghalat hai. Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : is hadees ki koi asal nahin."
"2515","Haddasana Ali bin Muhammad aur Muhammad bin Ismail, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Wakee, haddasana Shareek, Husain bin Abdullah bin Ubaidullah bin Abbas se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jo shakhs jiski laundi us se bacha jane to woh (laundi) uski maut ke baad azaad hogi.”"
"2516","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki mojudgi mein (Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key betey) Hazrat Ibrahim (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida ka zikr huwa to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uskey betey ney isey azad karwa diya ."
"2517","Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya aur Ishaq bin Mansoor, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Abdur Razzaq, Ibn Juraij se, Abu Zubair ne mujhe khabar di ke unhone Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Hum apni sarari (laundiyon) aur umm-e-waldaat ko bechte the aur nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan zinda the, hum is mein koi harj nahi samajhte the."
"2518","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen qism key tamam aadmiyon ki madad Allah ney apney zimmey ley li hai. Allah key raastey mein jang karney wala, wo makatib jo adaegi ka irada rakhta hai aur wo nikah karney wala jiska maqsad pak daman rehna hai."
"2519","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis ghulam sey so oqiye key iwaz makatibat ki gaee aur usney raqam ada kar di, sirf das oqiye uskey zimmey reh gaey to wo ghulam hi rahega ."
"2520","ummul-mominin Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab kisi aurat ka ghulam makatib ho aur uskey paas ada karney (aur azad ho janey) key liye raqam mojud ho to maalika ko us sey parda karna chahiye ."
"2521","Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki zoja mohtarma (paak bivi) Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Barira (Raziallahu anha) un ki khidmat mein hazir huin jabke un ki makatibat ho chuki thi . unkey malikon ney un sey no oqiye par makatibat ( azadi) ka muahida kya tha. ummul-mominin (Raziallahu anha) ney unhen kaha : agar tumharey malikon ki marzi ho to main puri raqam eik baar hi ada kar dun b-sharte-ke wala ka haq mujhey hasil ho. Hazrat Barira (Raziallahu anha) ney apney malikon key paas ja kar is baat ka tazkira kya to wo na maaney magar is shart par ke wala unhi key liye hoga ( unhoney israr kya ke wala ka haq unhi ko hasil hoga .) ummul-mominin Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein ye maamla pesh kya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : muahida kar lo . phir (uskey baad) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney khadey ho kar logon sey khitab kya, (us mein) Allah ki hamd o sana key baad aap ney farmaya : kya wajah hai ke kuch log aisi shartein lagatey hain jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin. har wo shart jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin, wo kal-adam hai agar-che so shartein hon. Allah ki kitab sachi hai, aur uski shart ziyada mazbut hai (jis par amal karna zaruri hai.) wala uski hoti hai jo (raqam ada kar key) azad kerey."
"2522","Hazrat Shurehbil bin Samt kandi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) sey kaha : aey Kaab bin Murra ! hamen Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki hadees sunaaiye , aur ehtiyat kijiye (ke hadees mein kami beshi na ho jaey .) unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye farman suna hai : jisney eik musalman mard ko azad kya to wo jahannam sey (bachaney key liye) uska fidya bin jaeyga. us (ghulam) ki har haddi key badley mein aaqa ki har haddi azad hogi. aur jisney do musalman aurton ko azad kya to wo jahannam sey uska fidya bin jaeyngi. un dono ki do haddiyon key badley uski eik haddi azad ho jaeygi."
"2523","Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey arz kya : aey Allah key Rasool! kon sa ghulam (londi) azad karna afzal hai? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo malikon ki nazar mein ziyada umda ho, aur jiski qeemat ziyada ho."
"2524","Haddasana Uqbah bin Mukram aur Ishaq bin Mansoor, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Muhammad bin Bakr al-Bursani, Hammad bin Salamah se, Qatadah aur Asim se, Hasan se, Samurah bin Jundub se, nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jisne kisi mahram rishtedaar par malikiyat hasil ki, woh azaad hai.”"
"2525","Haddasana Rashid bin Saeed ar-Ramali aur Ubaidullah bin al-Jahm al-Anmati, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Zamrah bin Rabiah, Sufyan se, Abdullah bin Dinar se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Jisne kisi mahram rishtedaar par malikiyat hasil ki, woh azaad hai.”"
"2526","Hazrat abu-Abdur-Rehman Safina (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mujhey ummul-mominin Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ney azad kya tha aur ye shart laga di thi ke jab tak Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) zinda hain, mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat karta rahun ."
"2527","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney ghulam mein sey apna hissa ya farmaya : eik hissa azad kar diya to agar uskey paas maal hai to is par lazim hai ke apna maal kharch kar key (doosrey sharikon ko unka hissa dekar) usey azadi dilaaey . agar us ( azad karney waley) key paas (itna) maal na ho to ghulam sey uski qeemat key liye mazduri karaai jaeygi lekin is par (uski taqat sey) ziyada bojh nahin dala jaeyga."
"2528","Haddasana Abu Kuraib, haddasana Rashdin bin Saad aur Abdur Rahman al-Muharibi aur Abu Usamah aur Jaafar bin Aun, sab Ibn Anum se; Abu Kuraib ne kaha: aur haddasana Wakee, Sufyan se, Ibn Anum se, Imran bin Abd al-Maafiri se, Abdullah bin Amr se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: “Qarz ada kiya jayega uske sahib se qayamat ke din jab woh mar gaya ho, magar woh shakhs jo qarz kare teen mamlaat mein: woh shakhs jiski taqat Allah ki raah mein kamzor ho jaye to woh qarz leta hai taake us se Allah ke dushman aur apne dushman ke muqable mein taqat hasil kare; aur woh shakhs jiske paas koi musalman mare aur use kafan aur dafn karne ke liye kuch na ho to woh qarz leta hai; aur woh shakhs jo apne aap par (shadi na karne ki wajah se) gunaah ka khauf rakhta ho to woh apne deen ke dar se shadi karta hai (to qarz leta hai). Beshak Allah un (ki janib se) qayamat ke din ada farmayega.”"
